    <div class="row g-3 mb-2 reveal">
      <div class="col-md-10">
        <div class="intro-card">
          <p>All prices include labour and materials.</p>
          <p>Works include covering furniture and floors with protective dust sheets, filling cracks on walls and ceilings, painting 2 coats of white ceiling emulsion, 2 coats of vinyl matt emulsion on walls and 1 coat of white gloss/satin/eggshell on doors and skirtings.</p>
          <p>Properties will be inspected before work commences. Colour consultation included.</p>
          <p>No hidden costs.</p>
