    <div class="pt-head reveal">Exterior Painting Costs</div>
    <p class="pt-sub reveal">Pricing includes labour, materials, surface preparation, and paint application. Dublin's weather demands proper prep for a long-lasting, weather-resistant finish.</p>
    <div class="table-responsive reveal">
      <table class="ptbl">
        <thead><tr><th>Property Type</th><th>Size Range</th><th>Estimated Price</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Terraced House</td><td>Small (80–120 m²)</td><td>€1,200 – €2,000</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Terraced House</td><td>Medium (120–150 m²)</td><td>€1,800 – €2,500</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Semi-Detached</td><td>Medium (120–180 m²)</td><td>€1,800 – €3,000</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Semi-Detached</td><td>Large (180–220 m²)</td><td>€2,500 – €3,800</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Detached House</td><td>Medium (150–220 m²)</td><td>€2,500 – €4,000</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Detached House</td><td>Large (220–350 m²)</td><td>€3,500 – €5,500</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Detached House</td><td>Very Large (350+ m²)</td><td>€5,000 – €9,000+</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
