      <li>Minor surface repairs</li><li>Priming where required</li><li>Two coats high-quality exterior masonry paint</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="pt-head reveal">Interior Painting Costs</div>
    <p class="pt-sub reveal">Costs depend on room size, surface condition, paint quality, and finishing detail required.</p>
    <div class="table-responsive reveal">
      <table class="ptbl">
        <thead><tr><th>Room Type</th><th>Average Size</th><th>Standard Price</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Small Bedroom</td><td>8–12 m²</td><td>€250 – €350</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Master Bedroom</td><td>15–22 m²</td><td>€350 – €450</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Living Room</td><td>18–25 m²</td><td>€350 – €500</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Kitchen</td><td>10–20 m²</td><td>€400 – €550</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Hallway, Stairs &amp; Landing</td><td>Varies</td><td>€500 – €700</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Bathroom</td><td>5–10 m²</td><td>€200 – €300</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Dining Room</td><td>12–20 m²</td><td>€300 – €450</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Home Office</td><td>8–15 m²</td><td>€250 – €400</td></tr>
        </tbody>
