          <tr><td>Skirting, architraves, window frames</td><td>€120 – €250 per room</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Feature Wall</td><td>€100 – €200 additional</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Metal Clading, Barriers and Fences</td><td>Ask</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Wallpaper</td><td>Ask</td></tr>
